jobs.description:
• You will be employed in the workshop as a (hand) polisher with the possibility of growth to machine polisher (CNC controlled);

• You will do all kind of manual processing of stones like polishing, gluing, etc

• You roll up your sleeves;

• You help produce worktops with the greatest precision.







• You have already experience with natural stone 

• You have a feeling for material;

• You work accurately;

• You are honest and have respect for both materials and colleagues;

• You take pride in what you do;

• You are flexible;

• You can perform under pressure, in busy periods there are deadlines to be met;

• You have a technical background;

• You have a good knowledge of the Dutch or English language.
